//   the dev player imports them all (src/capabilities/all.mjs) and still installs only those in needs.
// - install(door) runs once per engine, for each capability that the package's needs names (packageNeeds below)
//   and that is registered. A capability not named in needs never installs. It gets a door, never the engine
//   (principle 4): see makeDoor. It returns the hooks below (all optional).
// - attach(ctx) runs in a browser page after the player shows its first scene. ctx is {player, state, container,
//   win, options}. It may return an object with sync(), called after each step that changes the page.
//
// Hooks (address: a block's address; a, c, doc: copies of the content, which a capability cannot change):
//   actions: {key: (address, a, E) => void}  the action keys it adds (E evaluates a formula of the action)
//   controls: {kind: (address, id, c, arg) => void}  the control kinds it adds
