//                          story graph's memory (3.8): save gives the plain data to store, load checks stored data
//   clock: {begin(), next(end) -> {due, run(results)} | null, end(end)}  a capability's own ticks during advance,
//                          in time order with the deadlines; a deadline goes before a tick at the same time. The
